          "text": "Chhath Puja, a cherished Hindu festival, echoes with cultural vibrancy, connecting communities across India and Nepal. As we explore the rich traditions of Chhath Puja, let’s draw parallels to the values upheld by Admizz Education – a celebration of knowledge, achievement, and the journey of students aspiring to study abroad."
