          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Rooted in ancient scriptures, Chhath Puja’s cultural significance spans generations. The festival’s practice since the Mahabharata era highlights the enduring connection between tradition and the pursuit of knowledge, a value championed by Admizz Education."
