        {
          "_key": "a4f220db555e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The disciplined fast observed during Chhath Puja resonates with the commitment and perseverance exhibited by students in their academic pursuits, symbolizing a hunger for knowledge."
